{"ref":"BDB, מִרְמָס","hw":"מִרְמָס","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִרְמָס</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong> [<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>trampling-place, trampling</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:10\" href=\"/Micah.7.10\">Mi 7:10</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִרְמַס</span> (Kö<sup>ii. 1, 96</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.6\">Is 10:6</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִרְמַס</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.25\">7:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.19\">Ez 34:19</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong> trampling-place,</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ שֶׂה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.25\">Is 7:25</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִשְׁלַח</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ רַגְלֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:19\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.19\">Ez 34:19</a> (fig.).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>trampling</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהָיָה לְמ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.5\">Is 5:5</a> <em>it shall become a trampling</em>, be trampled down, so <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:10\" href=\"/Micah.7.10\">Mi 7:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.18\">Is 28:18</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">והייתם לו למרמס</span>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.6\">10:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:13\" href=\"/Daniel.8.13\">Dn 8:13</a>.","next":"BDB, רָמַשׂ","prev":"BDB, רָמַס"}